        "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
        "sentence_id": "sentence_b46a957553bea93a1be2b5b3",
        "source_text": "Strictly speaking, :eqref:`eq_price-area` is an *affine transformation*\nof input features,\nwhich is characterized by\na *linear transformation* of features via weighted sum, combined with\na *translation* via the added bias.",
