        "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
        "sentence_id": "sentence_c92b0ae109bc793e79712a07",
        "source_text": "Models whose output prediction\nis determined by the affine transformation of input features\nare *linear models*,\nwhere the affine transformation is specified by the chosen weights and bias.",
